Pickle Rota foundations: multi-tenant scheduler, landing page, backend, docs

Grown from the single-group Slapton Village Hall scheduler (preserved in
legacy/). Adds: per-group instances at /g/{slug} with user-set hashed
organiser passwords, landing page for creating/opening groups, per-group
manifest for home-screen install, 90-day stale-group cleanup (opportunistic
on create + cron endpoint), and full decision/deployment documentation.
